        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cain Velasquez, Brock Lesnar, Junior dos Santos\n- Organizations: UFC, WWE\n- Events: King of the Ring (2006), King of the Ring (2002)\n- Roles: UFC Heavyweight Champion, professional wrestler, mixed martial artist, football player, amateur wrestler\n\nFacts:\n- Brock Lesnar won the 2002 King of the Ring tournament.\n- The King of the Ring (2006) tournament was held between April 14 and May 21, 2006.\n- The King of the Ring (2006) tournament was the first King of the Ring tournament held since the 2002 tournament.\n- Brock Lesnar was born on July 12, 1977.\n- Brock Lesnar is an American professional wrestler, former professional mixed martial artist, former professional American football player, and amateur wrestler.\n- Brock Lesnar is currently signed with WWE.\n- Cain Velasquez is a former two-time UFC Heavyweight Champion.\n- Cain Velasquez has victories over Brock Lesnar and Junior dos Santos.",
